OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Call of the Wild
OL,6,     FBroadcaster Verity Sharp talks to
OL,7,     Fatmosphere artist Leena Lee about
OL,8,     Fthe hidden potential of birdsong
OL,9,     Fthrough the squirrel cuckoo of the
OL,10,     FLacandon jungle.
OL,11,G2200 Late Junction
OL,12,     FVerity Sharp is hot out of the
OL,13,     Fgate with a selection of tracks
OL,14,     Finspired by, made from, and
OL,15,     Frelated to horses. Expect
OL,16,     Fhorse-hair harps and musical
OL,17,     Fequine pilgrimages.
